Narwhals are medium tusked whales which live in [[Deep Water|Very Deep Ocean]]. They can spawn solo or in pods of 2-4.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Narwhals are low aggressive, and will engage in combat with nearby players. Aggroing any one narwhal will cause the entire pod to also engage.

