===Strategy===

Note that unlike other creatures, narwhals never split - so you can't aggro them one by one. 

You can Safespot them by luring them to the edge of Deep Ocean, they will not follow you onto Shallow Ocean terrain.

Narwhal's can swim through Deep Ocean and Deep water (Rivers)

